==Welsh==

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|standard}} {{IPA|cy|/ɛð/}}
** {{a|informal}} {{IPA|cy|/ð/}}

===Letter===
{{cy-letter|upper=Dd|lower=dd}}

# {{Latn-def|cy|letter|6|èdd}} ''It is preceded by {{l|cy|d}} and followed by {{l|cy|e}}.''

====Usage notes====
Like the other Welsh digraphs, {{m|cy|dd}} is considered a distinct letter of the Welsh alphabet for all purposes, including collation. Thus, {{m|cy|ddoe}} is alphabetically sorted '''after''' {{m|cy|dydd}}.

===Mutation===
* {{m|cy|dd}} cannot be mutated in Welsh.

